{"id":"08a47204ea81e603","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-cfl-nonclosure-examples.md","title":"Nonclosure under Intersection and Complement","display":"thm-context-free-nonclosure-witnesses — Nonclosure under Intersection and Complement","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-cfl-nonclosure-examples","aliases":["73-thm-cfl-nonclosure-examples","73-thm-context-free-nonclosure-witnesses"],"display":"thm-context-free-nonclosure-witnesses — Nonclosure under Intersection and Complement","depends_on":["[[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","[[73-thm-cfg-positive-closure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-cfl-nonclosure-examples"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-cfl-nonclosure-examples</span><span>73-thm-context-free-nonclosure-witnesses</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-context-free-nonclosure-witnesses — Nonclosure under Intersection and Complement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c8c56808857d2df\" href=\"?note=5c8c56808857d2df\" title=\"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound\">73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"02910c90a7bc9f14\" href=\"?note=02910c90a7bc9f14\" title=\"73-thm-cfg-positive-closure\">73-thm-cfg-positive-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_3=\\{a,b,c\\}\">\\(\\Sigma_3=\\{a,b,c\\}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma_3)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma_3)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\Sigma_3|=3\">\\(|\\Sigma_3|=3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\">\\(\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\\)</span> (context-free languages, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>上下文无关语言的泵引理采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5c8c56808857d2df\" href=\"?note=5c8c56808857d2df\" title=\"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound\">73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\Sigma_3\">\\(\\Sigma=\\Sigma_3\\)</span> 实例；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\">\\(a,b,c\\)</span> 的两两不等由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\Sigma_3|=3\">\\(|\\Sigma_3|=3\\)</span> 保证。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}nonclosure\\text{-}witnesses}\\vdash\n\\exists A,B\\subseteq\\Sigma_3^*\\;\\Bigl[\nA=\\{a^ib^ic^j:i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\land B=\\{a^ib^jc^j:i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\land A\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\\land B\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\n\\land A\\cap B=\\{a^nb^nc^n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\land A\\cap B\\notin\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\n\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}nonclosure\\text{-}witnesses}\\vdash\n\\exists A,B\\subseteq\\Sigma_3^*\\;\\Bigl[\nA=\\{a^ib^ic^j:i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\land B=\\{a^ib^jc^j:i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\land A\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\\land B\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\n\\land A\\cap B=\\{a^nb^nc^n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\land A\\cap B\\notin\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\n\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}nonclosure\\text{-}witnesses}\\vdash\n\\exists C\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\\;\n(\\Sigma_3^*\\setminus C\\notin\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}nonclosure\\text{-}witnesses}\\vdash\n\\exists C\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\\;\n(\\Sigma_3^*\\setminus C\\notin\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Simple grammars witness <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\\land B\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\\land B\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\\)</span>; the CFL pumping lemma excludes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{a^nb^nc^n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\{a^nb^nc^n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>If CFLs were closed under complement, their closure under union and De Morgan's law would imply closure under intersection, contradicting the explicit pair <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The old phrase “not in CFL in general” applied to arbitrary fixed languages and was false; the corrected assertions are existential nonclosure witnesses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound","status":"resolved","id":"5c8c56808857d2df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfg-positive-closure","status":"resolved","id":"02910c90a7bc9f14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfg-positive-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_3=\\{a,b,c\\}$ with $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma_3)$ and $|\\Sigma_3|=3$ (see [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}$ (context-free languages, see [[73-df-cfg-language-class]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound","status":"resolved","id":"5c8c56808857d2df","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"上下文无关语言的泵引理采用 [[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]] 的 $\\Sigma=\\Sigma_3$ 实例；$a,b,c$ 的两两不等由 $|\\Sigma_3|=3$ 保证。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma_3=\\{a,b,c\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma_3)","display":false},{"tex":"|\\Sigma_3|=3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\Sigma_3","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c","display":false},{"tex":"|\\Sigma_3|=3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}nonclosure\\text{-}witnesses}\\vdash\n\\exists A,B\\subseteq\\Sigma_3^*\\;\\Bigl[\nA=\\{a^ib^ic^j:i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\land B=\\{a^ib^jc^j:i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\land A\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\\land B\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\n\\land A\\cap B=\\{a^nb^nc^n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\n\\land A\\cap B\\notin\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\n\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}nonclosure\\text{-}witnesses}\\vdash\n\\exists C\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\\;\n(\\Sigma_3^*\\setminus C\\notin\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3})","display":true},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}\\land B\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma_3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{a^nb^nc^n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false}],"bytes":1995,"backlinks":[{"id":"68b47b6e126cab37","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["5c8c56808857d2df","0a6da8c909717780","83639a9615c06195","02910c90a7bc9f14"]}